---
import LegalDraftNotice from "../LegalDraftNotice.astro";
import Section from "../ui/Section.astro";
import site from "../../data/site.json";

---

<Section
  id="privacy-policy"
  headingLevel="h1"
  eyebrow="Legal information"
  heading="Privacy policy"
  intro="This draft explains what information the forms on this website ask for and how it is used."
>
  <article class="legal-content">
    <LegalDraftNotice />
    <p>
      This website has forms for the purposes below. Please do not include
      information about children that could identify them in a prayer request.
    </p>

    <h2>Information from forms</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Newsletter:</strong> your email address and consent, so the
        Foundation can send occasional updates.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Contact:</strong> your name, email, optional phone number,
        subject, and message, so the Foundation can respond to your message.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Partnership enquiry:</strong> organisation, contact person,
        email, optional phone number, partnership type, message, and consent, so
        the Foundation can review and respond to the enquiry.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Volunteer application:</strong> name, email, phone number, role
        interest, availability, short message, and consent, so the Foundation
        can review and follow up about the application.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Prayer request:</strong> an optional first name, prayer
        request, optional email, privacy preference, and consent, so the
        Foundation can receive the request and reply if requested.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Prayer partner:</strong> your indication of interest, optional
        email, and consent, so the Foundation can record your interest and
        follow up if requested.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How form submissions are handled</h2>
    <p>
      Form submissions are stored through Netlify Forms and emailed to the
      Foundation's team for the purposes described above. The team notification
      email address is [to be confirmed].
    </p>
    <p>
      How long submissions are kept: [to be confirmed]. Who on the team can
      access submissions: [to be confirmed]. The Foundation's privacy contact:
      [to be confirmed].
    </p>

    <h2>Donations and third-party services</h2>
    <p>
      Donations are made through third parties: the online fundraiser organised
      by a friend of the Foundation, and MTN Mobile Money. We do not collect
      card numbers or PINs on this website. The fundraiser platform's details
      and privacy information: [to be confirmed].
    </p>

    <h2>Map and cookies</h2>
    <p>
      No analytics tools are currently installed. The map on the Contact page
      does not contact Google Maps unless you choose to load it. If you do,
      your browser makes a request to Google Maps, which may handle information
      under its own terms. Further details: [to be confirmed]. The choice is
      not saved between visits.
    </p>
    <p>
      There is no general cookie or consent banner because this site does not
      use analytics, and the map asks before it loads. Review of any third-party
      service requirements: [to be confirmed].
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Privacy questions: [to be confirmed]. Foundation email:
      {site.email.needsConfirmation ? "[to be confirmed]" : site.email.value}.
    </p>
  </article>
</Section>
